The exact recovery of the planted cap position validates the below/above-\$300 split. Note that the synthesis constructs two cleanly separated regimes so that the realised-price split coincides with the planted cover; on real AEMO data it will not be that clean, which is exactly why `markup_inversion_ci` bootstraps the slope and SRMC. **Always report the band, never the point.**

