# APPENDIX A — Master equation reference card

**Per-interval margin (Module A):**
$$\pi_i = \Delta t\Big[G_i(L S_i - \mathrm{SRMC}_i) - N\max(S_i-K,0) + N p\Big]$$

**Quarterly margin:**
$$\Pi = \sum_i \pi_i - \sum_{\text{starts}}\mathrm{SC} - \mathrm{FOM}$$

**Covered / uncovered decomposition:**
$$G S - N(S-K) = K G - (N-G)(S-K)$$

**Defended spike with MLF:**
$$L N S - N(S-K) = N\big(K - (1-L)S\big)$$

**Capture price and merchant energy margin:**
$$P_{\text{cap}} = \frac{\sum_i S_i G_i}{\sum_i G_i}, \qquad \sum_i G_i \Delta t (L S_i - \mathrm{SRMC}) = E(L P_{\text{cap}} - \mathrm{SRMC})$$

**SRMC:**
$$\mathrm{SRMC}_i = \mathrm{HR}(G_i)(P^{\text{gas}}_i + T^{\text{gas}}) + \mathrm{VOM}, \qquad \mathrm{HR} = 3.6/\eta$$

**Commitment (heuristic start rule):**
$$\text{start if } q\cdot\Delta\cdot(\text{deliverable MW}) > \mathrm{SC} + \mathbb{E}[\text{min-load loss over }\tau_{\text{start}}]$$

**Cap-leg risk premium:**
$$N H\big(p - \mathbb{E}_P[\max(S-K,0)]\big)$$

**Instrument P&L to the seller (Module C):**
$$\pi_{sw} = H(F - \bar S), \qquad \pi_{cap} = H(p - \bar C), \qquad M_h = M_o + q_{sw}\pi_{sw} + q_{cap}\pi_{cap}$$

**Netted owner margin:**
$$M_o = \sum_g M_g^{\text{thermal}} + M^{\text{renew}} - M^{\text{retail}}$$

**Swap reservation:**
$$F^*(q_{sw}) = \mathbb{E}[\bar S] + \frac{\lambda}{H}\Big[q_{sw}\mathrm{Var}[\pi_{sw}] + q_{cap}\mathrm{Cov}(\pi_{sw},\pi_{cap}) + \mathrm{Cov}(M_o,\pi_{sw})\Big]$$
$$F^*(0) = \mathbb{E}[\bar S] - \lambda\,\mathrm{Cov}(M_o,\bar S)$$

**Cap reservation (mean-variance reference):**
$$p^*(0) = \mathbb{E}[\bar C] - \lambda\,\mathrm{Cov}(M_o,\bar C)$$

**Retailer buy reservation:**
$$p^{\text{buy}*}_R(0) = \mathbb{E}[\bar C] + \lambda_R\big|\mathrm{Cov}(M_R,\bar C)\big|$$

**CVaR (Rockafellar–Uryasev):**
$$\mathrm{CVaR}_\alpha(L) = \min_{\zeta, z_j\ge 0}\ \zeta + \frac{1}{\alpha J}\sum_j z_j \quad \text{s.t.}\quad z_j \ge L_j - \zeta$$

**Owner's program:**
$$\max\ \frac{1}{J}\sum_j M_{h,j} - \frac{\lambda}{2}\widehat{\mathrm{Var}}[M_h] - \gamma\Big(\zeta + \frac{1}{\alpha J}\sum_j z_j\Big)$$

**Fleet aggregation:**
$$Q^{\text{supply}}_{cap}(p) = \sum_o q^*_{cap,o}(p)$$

**Implied reservation:**
$$\lambda^{\text{impl}} = \frac{\mathbb{E}[\bar C] - p_{\text{screen}}}{\mathrm{Cov}(M_{\text{marginal}},\bar C)}$$

**Financial-disclosure regression (Module D):**
$$R_t/Q_t = a + b\bar S_t + \varepsilon_t, \qquad \text{hedge cover} \approx 1 - b$$

**Markup inversion:**
$$\bar q = q - (P - \mathrm{SRMC})\,|DR'(P)|$$
$$\widehat q_{cap} = \bar q_{\text{eff}}\big|_{P\ge300} - \bar q\big|_{P<300}$$

**OI ceiling:**
$$\sum_g \widehat q_{cap,g} \le \mathrm{OI}_{cap} - \text{retailer long} - \text{spec long}$$

**Calibration:**
$$\min_{\{\lambda_o,\gamma_o\}}\ \sum_o\big(q^*_{cap,o}(p_{\text{screen}}) - \widehat q_{cap,o}\big)^2 \quad \text{s.t. Step 14 bounds}$$

